<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:lang="lzh"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>狂人上壽</title><title type="alternate">Kuang ren shang shou [A Long-Lived Resident of a Hospital for the Insane]</title><author>無署名（《東華新報》）</author><respStmt><resp>整理與編碼</resp><name>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu)</name></respStmt></titleStmt><editionStmt><edition>Transcription dataset v0.2.0</edition></editionStmt><publicationStmt><p>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu). Dataset edition 0.2.0.</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>東華新報</title><date when="1899-06-10">1899-06-10</date><idno>Tung Wah News, 1899-06-10, p. 3, NLA news-page24102427</idno><ref target="https://trove.nla.gov.au/newspaper/page/24102427">澳洲國家圖書館 Trove</ref></bibl></sourceDesc></fileDesc></teiHeader><facsimile><surface n="3" xml:id="original-page"><graphic url="https://trove.nla.gov.au/ndp/imageservice/nla.news-page24102427/level5" /></surface></facsimile><text><body><div type="article"><pb n="3" facs="#original-page" /><p><lb n="single-1" />○狂人上壽　孑厘濱屬之橋埠狂人院有西人失其常性者入該院就養至<lb n="single-2" />九十六歲而終按其人當壯年時效力沙場受傷深重醫未復元至有失性之病入該院二十六年又昔<lb n="single-3" />日在爺刺扁之病院十三年共三十九年而獲上壽乃卒諺云庸人多壽觀此信然譯六月二號西報</p></div></body></text></TEI>